      "elevFt": 3707
    },
    {
      "id": "m01",
      "row": 1,
      "submittedAt": "11/2/2026 7:09:28",
      "text": "1. Camping with me, Debbie, Danny and Taylor as a 2 year old! They let me come with them. Such a sweet memory. I was around 14 years old and we ‘showered’ with a bucket of cold water hanging from a tree! It was so much fun. \n2. Going on big walks with Uncle Danny around his neighborhood and even Amarillo at Fleetwood Park talking about all the things of life… I appreciate how much time he has invested in me as his niece - all the love and laughs!\n3. He gave Elli her first haircut 😂 But then he saved the lock of hair for me!",
