      "id": "m08",
      "row": 8,
      "submittedAt": "11/3/2026 14:20:49",
      "text": "Our Russell family of 5 has memories of sleeping over with Danny and Debbie in their home in Colorado Springs. Danny and Debbie were always super hospitable to us. I remember big meals, walks around their backyard garden, walks around the neighborhood and the boys’ old toys they would put out for my kids to use. Danny would talk about how the buffs were playing, old hunting buddies, his boys and splash in a bit of some controversial politics.These are really good memories!! Thank you, Danny, for being such a great uncle!",
